OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer who misled police over
OL,4,Aex-partner is fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police misconduct panel found an
OL,7,Fofficer deliberately misled senior
OL,8,Fcolleagues about her links to a former
OL,9,Fpartner and his convicted criminal
OL,10,Fbrother.
OL,12,FThe now-former Cambridgeshire officer
OL,13,Fpreviously reported being a victim of
OL,14,Fdomestic abuse by her ex and said she
OL,15,Fwas forced to help conceal evidence
OL,16,Flinked to a serious offence committed
OL,17,Fby his brother.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
