OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer who misled police over
OL,4,Aex-partner is fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe made the report years after the
OL,7,Fincident while working for
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire Police, telling that
OL,9,Fforce she had not made contact with her
OL,10,Fformer partner since 2019.
OL,12,FBut phone and social media evidence
OL,13,Fsuggested otherwise, and
OL,14,FCambridgeshire's chief constable Simon
OL,15,FMegicks dismissed her without notice
OL,16,Fand barred her from policing.
